---
import Icon from "./ui/Icon.astro"
import { STEPS } from "../constants/site"
---

<section class="relative flex min-h-screen flex-col items-center justify-center gap-12 overflow-hidden bg-primary px-6 md:px-10 lg:px-16 py-[60px]" id="como-funciona" aria-label="Como funciona o atendimento">
  <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 text-dark-card/50 pointer-events-none">
    <span class="md:hidden"><Icon name="scale" size={300} strokeWidth="1" /></span>
    <span class="max-md:hidden"><Icon name="scale" size={400} strokeWidth="1" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 flex w-full max-w-[1200px] items-start gap-12 max-md:flex-col">
    <div class="reveal flex flex-1 flex-col" data-reveal>
      <span class="font-heading text-[30px] font-bold text-accent-light leading-snug">Sua Jornada de Defesa,</span>
      <span class="font-heading text-[28px] font-bold text-accent-dark uppercase">COMO FUNCIONA ?</span>
    </div>
    <p class="reveal flex-1 font-body text-sm text-accent-light/70" data-reveal>
      Desde o primeiro contato, nos dedicamos a esclarecer e simplificar o processo trabalhista para você, garantindo a melhor estratégia e acompanhamento em todas as etapas.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="reveal-stagger relative z-10 flex w-full max-w-[1200px] items-center max-md:flex-col" data-reveal>
    {STEPS.map((step, i) => (
      <>
        <div class="reveal group flex flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-[10px] border border-border-dark bg-dark-card px-6 py-7 h-[270px] max-md:w-full min-w-0 max-w-[300px] transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-xl hover:border-accent/20">
          <span class="relative z-10 font-heading text-[40px] font-bold text-accent/50">{step.number}</span>
          <div class="relative z-10 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-accent-light">
            <Icon name={step.icon} size={24} class="text-border-dark" />
          </div>
          <span class="relative z-10 text-center font-body text-[15px] font-semibold text-accent-light">{step.title}</span>
          <span class="relative z-10 text-center font-body text-[13px] text-accent-light/70">{step.description}</span>
        </div>
        {i < STEPS.length - 1 && (
          <div class="reveal flex w-5 items-center justify-center shrink-0 max-md:w-auto max-md:py-0">
            <span class="block h-0.5 w-5 bg-border-dark max-md:hidden"></span>
            <span class="hidden w-0.5 h-6 bg-border-dark max-md:block"></span>
          </div>
        )}
      </>
    ))}
  </div>
</section>
